# Legendary landwalk (CR 702.14c) needs a land that is legendary: Ayumi, the Last Visitor attacking Bot2 may be blocked by
# Bot2's Memnite when Bot2 controls only Tundra (a nonbasic land that is not legendary) and Sundial, Dawn Tyrant (a
# legendary permanent that is not a land). Bot1's own Karakas, a legendary land, does not matter either: it is the defending
# player's lands that count. Memnite takes 7 and dies; Ayumi takes 1; Bot2 takes nothing.
# Bot1 plays Karakas and casts Ayumi on turn 1 (two Black Lotuses, green); Bot2 plays Tundra and casts Sundial (Moxen Pearl
# and Jet) and Memnite on turn 2.

[Bot1 Deck]
Karakas
Black Lotus x2
Ayumi, the Last Visitor
Forest x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Tundra
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Sundial, Dawn Tyrant
Memnite
Plains x19

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Karakas.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus#2.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Hand.Ayumi, the Last Visitor.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Tundra.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Sundial, Dawn Tyrant.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Attack(Ayumi, the Last Visitor > Bot2)
Bot2.Block(Memnite > Ayumi, the Last Visitor)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

